  //   constrained branch, if ConstrainedStep returns eosToken we break without
  //   changing the constrained state; otherwise AppendConstrainedToken extends
  //   the constrained prefix by a parser-valid next token, preserving validity.
  //   In the wide constrained branch, ConstrainedSymbol returns currentOut that
  //   is a valid parser prefix, so assigning currentConstrainedOut := currentOut
  //   preserves the invariant.
  //
  // suffix: In the opening branch, currentConstrainedOut becomes [], so the
