  //   manual-close branch, we first establish parser.IsCompletePrefix on the
  //   current constrained prefix and then set insideConstrainedOut := false and
  //   currentConstrainedOut := [], so the implication is vacuous afterwards.
  //   Breaks preserve the last assigned state.
